      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I've watched over many Arisen here,\r\nbut how should I put it...\r\nLately, I feel like there are more\r\nstylish Arisen with a great fashion sense.",
        "Jp" : "私はこの場所で多くの覚者様を見守っているの\r\nですが、何と言いましょうか\r\n最近、お洒落でハイセンスな着こなし上手の\r\n覚者様が、多くなったように思うのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 271625,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "There must be some secret to it.\r\nIf you're interested in fashion as well,\r\nperhaps you should look into it.",
        "Jp" : "きっとなにか秘密があるに違いありません\r\nもし覚者様もお洒落に興味がおありでしたら\r\n一度お調べになってはいかがでしょうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 271626,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I've heard that Mel the Bazaar merchant is\r\nknowledgeable about fashion items and styling.\r\nShe might know something about it.",
        "Jp" : "バザー商のメルが、お洒落アイテムや着こなしに\r\n明るいと聞いたことがあります\r\n彼女なら何か知っているかもしれません"
      },
