      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I shall comply, Arisen.\r\nSeems you have a good eye for this.\r\nAllow me to impart this technique to you.",
        "Jp" : "承知した\r\n覚者よ、おまえは見る目がある者のようだ\r\nこの術について伝えよう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 271637,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 26,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "One day, Master Fabio used a strange technique\r\nto \"layer\" this armor over my existing one.\r\nIt happened all in an instant...",
        "Jp" : "ファビオ様は、ある日私に不思議な術で\r\n鎧の上からこの鎧を\"さらに着せた\"のだ\r\nあっという間のことだった――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 271638,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 27,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And then he said,\r\n\"The key is the chest piece and lace-up leggings.\r\nIf you have the eye to appreciate these things,\r\nI might teach you the art.\"",
        "Jp" : "そして、こう言われた\r\n「こだわりは胸当てと編み上げレギンスだ\r\n　このセンスが分かる、見る目がある奴には\r\n　術について教えてやってもいいぞ」と"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 271639,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
